# Where the .githooks wrappers cache the central hook scripts they fetch.
.ai-shared/
# The pre-rename cache path. Nothing writes it any more; it stays ignored so a checkout that
# still carries one is not turned into an untracked-file failure by this rename.
.claude-shared/
# Everything under .githooks/ except the two bootstrap wrappers is written by provisioning from
# that cache, so only those two are the repository's to carry.
.githooks/*
!.githooks/pre-commit
!.githooks/post-checkout
# Auto-generated AI instruction files
CLAUDE.md
CODEX.md
ANTIGRAVITY.md
# Session state under .claude/ stays local, except the marker that tells the commit wrapper
# this repository is public.
.claude/*
!.claude/.public
.codex/
.agents/
